C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNs3XcLpk7fbXWT4cH3EAvIMKYO2KW7H__P2oiiTtNQzzrwyYSOolLSTtRaCdv6PJbFpWd465I9tQoxO8e0usuMsF9tEy90_mTXc94H956UTAm8HzfUTpe8XxfIub5QCy4CuU3HXxerkTeF=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNGV5KqgOfeVGlXTVEXPgzhyTLgqIBtP97BAQhSsDn6-tpX1ySv_-Bp7aAFkW-IjoA_fhOQTa4YEPiom_VwFMp34762VPRAn2bUEyFTqty1JG19E-db4kZb4RVeyzRKunbH500BUmdCOyyk=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMRLUcSektZYH1eIxwedpwvXgfgk9J2NiXUMmZVVHONXZaG7YkSUp0BwxgGiAbO0e-6j2QAq73AnuDpSZ_zqAAWFDXYt4ZxBNOm1SnqIYPWQ7jDEJg887L7wOi7SrbGsNR8Qmj3oESu5yM=k-no"}],"date":"3 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-06-19T08:06:42+00:00"},{"username":"Sonam Satija","rating":5,"contributor_id":"116375139671965837620","user_review_count":11,"user_photo_count":7,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDqlMfG-MY0r2A-4Tj4UZ7GiB_vH-RGeGXJrBAua0CPos6Zw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"I went for lunch date to Lazy Goose, trust me it was one of the most memorable days. Live music really changed the vibe of the whole place, the food was too good, don't forget to try their cocktails, my favorite was Picante. The backwater view was a cherry on top, it's perfect for family dining as well, everybody seems to enjoy the whole vibe of the place. Would definitely recommend adding this one to your itinerary.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxbmQwNWthV2hIZGxnNFZHcFVPSEpWTlU5clgzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x77aaefc15cce98f8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi1nd05kaWhHdlg4VGpUOHJVNU9rX3c%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPEisygrS5pIVE_DF5485jsOXf1Fh7Afk9avjOyNb53tQ5iv8atpyxGbQLX6BlF7MF5DCsxnrTdpd6h0UOATZFcm-AxCaWbRVVuR_smtsMdLnm7TlWC3yjaL4O5cDDr8qNCxXXNtjyg4TXi=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMQpO7_FZ7Gjb6yBw3-Wu7rMkp-OK0nmKfxaMfLbtooHKOYG98x4Q